call tzone x=0 z=-15.67 al=hallzone id=smelter_hall r=4 msg="The smelter hall. Cold now - but the iron inside still smells of fire."
call tzone x=1.14 z=-0.09 al=weatherzone id=weather_room r=3 h=3.2 msg="The weather room, up on the hall's roof: dials, barometers, a dish - every needle stopped on STORM."
